{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903900/extras/7b6ac2f6ef471608e9f3c0ecfbeee94a.avif?t=1760227275\" width=982 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STREAM is a chaotic co-op kayaking adventure where you and your crew must paddle down raging rivers filled with rocks, rapids, and surprises. Work together (or fall apart) as up to 4 players share one kayak and try to survive the ride! Coordination is key \u2013 too many crashes and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-player co-op with one kayak!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge rocks, rapids, and other river hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple but hilarious controls \u2013 paddle left, right, and hope for the best</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated river runs for endless replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different river environments with unique challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh, yell, and blame your friends when you crash</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your friends conquer the stream, or will you sink trying?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3903900?t=1760227275","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903900/e18ae4259af7ffbfaca3ba6bfde9a7c25309d09a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760227275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903900/5c1fc9752aab0335a7e3c8c97159dbb265d351fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760227275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903900/5c1fc9752aab0335a7e3c8c97159dbb265d351fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760227275","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903900/extras/7b6ac2f6ef471608e9f3c0ecfbeee94a.avif?t=1760227275\" width=982 height=215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STREAM is a chaotic co-op kayaking adventure where you and your crew must paddle down raging rivers filled with rocks, rapids, and surprises. Work together (or fall apart) as up to 4 players share one kayak and try to survive the ride! Coordination is key \u2013 too many crashes and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 4-player co-op with one kayak!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge rocks, rapids, and other river hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple but hilarious controls \u2013 paddle left, right, and hope for the best</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated river runs for endless replayability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different river environments with unique challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laugh, yell, and blame your friends when you crash</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your friends conquer the stream, or will you sink trying?</p>","developers":["Diabolical Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steams